verything.\n\nThe game combines pinball physics with tactical decision making. Pick a style of attack, line up the best angle, and launch! Watch Skip careen around the screen and break the giant beasts to pieces.\n\nAlong the way, you will meet a vibrant collection of characters who will help you craft new equipment, teach you completely unique fighting styles, and maybe even help you figure out where these Beasts came from...", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/beast-breaker", "videos": [{"id": 52315, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "oW9i8s_uSLQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oW9i8s_uSLQ", "title": "Beast Breaker Reveal", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oW9i8s_uSLQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}